        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-25T09:57:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In fact, it's the Christmas Five :&nbsp; Legacy makes public appearances in a red outfit, the Wraith investigates to know who was bad or good, Bunker planifies the deliveries and production (with help from their Assistant), Tachyon makes deliveries, Absolute Zero takes care of the climate and decorations. And of course Unity designs the toys.</p><p>This year, Baron Blade, under the name of Baron Grinch, tried to impede their work with a mezo-american themed giant robot called \"Kalendar\", but failed - the Argent Adept had organized enough chorals all over the world to keep Akash'Bhuta asleep.</p>",
